            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. If the affected employee is unable under Section a. above to bump within the classification the employee shall bump laterally or down within the seniority unit as defined in Section 1a(l) into any other classification previously held within the bargaining unit using the seniority procedure specified in a. above.",
            "block_bbox": [
