        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. During the period that employees are on a recall list, they shall keep the Employer informed of any changes in address. The Employer shall not be held liable if an employee is not offered to recall because of failure to notify the Employer of a change of address. An employee who is not offered to recall because of failure to notify the Employer of a change of address and who subsequently informs the Employer of the current address shall be returned to the recall list and",
